      src=\"./web/images/quote.svg\"\n              alt=\"img\"\n            />\n          </div>\n          <p\n            style={{\n              fontSize: \"17px\",\n              fontWeight: \"400\",\n              color: \"#313131\",\n              fontFamily: '\"Nunito\", sans-serif',\n              padding: \"20px 0\",\n              textAlign: \"justify\",\n            }}\n          >\n        The caliber of deals curated by Growth91 is nothing shorts of\n            exceptional. It's not just about quality;it's the meticulous\n            selection process that ensure each investment opportuntiy is a\n            potential game-changer. Quality over quantity truly defines\n            the investment landscapes on this platform. hope they\n            continueto do it in future also\n          </p>\n          <div\n            style={{\n              display: \"flex\",\n              alignItems: \"center\",\n              marginTop: \"50px\",\n            }}\n            className=\"media\"\n          >\n            <div\n              style={{\n                display: \"flex\",\n                alignItems: \"center\",\n                justifyContent: \"center\",\n                height: \"70px\",\n                width: \"70px\",\n                textAlign: \"center\",\n                background: \"#fff\",\n                border: \"1px solid #D3CBE2\",\n                borderRadius: \"50%\",\n                overflow: \"hidden\",\n                lineHeight: \"65px\",\n              }}\n              className=\"images\"\n            >\n              <img\n                style={{\n                  height: \"60px\",\n                  width: \"60px\",\n                  borderRadius: \"50%\",\n                  objectFit: \"cover\",\n                }}\n                src=\"./assets/images/testimonials/Prakash.jpg\"\n                alt=\"img\"\n              />\n            </div>\n            <div style={{ marginLeft: \"10px\" }} className=\"media-body\">\n              <a\n                style={{\n                  display: \"block\",\n                  fontSize: \"18px\",\n                  fontWeight: \"600\",\n                  color: \"#111111\",\n                  fontFamily: '\"Nunito\", serif',\n                }}\n                href=\"#\"\n              >\n               PRAKASH ROHERA\n              </a>\n              <small\n                style={{\n                  display: \"block\",\n                  fontSize: \"14px\",\n                  fontWeight: \"400\",\n                  fontFamily: '\"Nunito\", sans-serif',\n                  color: \"#313131\",\n                }}\n              >\n              INTERNATIONAL Corpoate <br />\n                Trainer and Coach\n              </small>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div\n          className=\"item mb-3\"\n          style={{\n           \n            \n            background: \"#fff\",\n            padding: \"18px 30px\",\n            boxShadow: \"0 30px 50px rgba(205, 196, 219, 0.3)\",\n            borderRadius: \"10px\",\n          }}\n        >\n          <div className=\"quotes\" style={{ width: \"30px\" }}>\n            <img\n              style={{ maxWidth: \"100%\" }}\n              src=\"./web/images/quote.svg\"\n              alt=\"img\"\n            />\n          </div>\n          <p\n            style={{\n              fontSize: \"17px\",\n              fontWeight: \"400\",\n              color: \"#313131\",\n              fontFamily: '\"Nunito\", sans-serif',\n              padding: \"20px 0\",\n              textAlign: \"justify\",\n            }}\n          >\n            I am a regular investor on Growth Sense and very happy with\n            kind of returns generated on my investments. Looking forward\n            to equally exciting opportunities at Growth91\n          </p>\n          <div\n            style={{\n              display: \"flex\",\n              alignItems: \"center\",\n              marginTop: \"30px\",\n            }}\n            className=\"media\"\n          >\n            <div\n              style={{\n                display: \"flex\",\n                alignItems: \"center\",\n                justifyContent: \"center\",\n                height: \"70px\",\n                width: \"70px\",\n                textAlign: \"center\",\n                background: \"#fff\",\n                border: \"1px solid #D3CBE2\",\n                borderRadius: \"50%\",\n                overflow: \"hidden\",\n                lineHeight: \"65px\",\n              }}\n              className=\"images\"\n            >\n              <img\n                style={{\n                  height: \"60px\",\n                  width: \"60px\",\n                  borderRadius: \"50%\",\n                  objectFit: \"cover\",\n                }}\n                src=\"./assets/images/testimonials/ramesh-babu.jpg\"\n                alt=\"img\"\n              />\n            </div>\n            <div style={{ marginLeft: \"10px\" }} className=\"media-body\">\n              <a\n                style={{\n                  display: \"block\",\n                  fontSize: \"18px\",\n                  fontWeight: \"600\",\n                  color: \"#111111\",\n                  fontFamily: '\"Nunito\", serif',\n                }}\n                href=\"#\"\n              >\n                Ramesh Babu\n              </a>\n              <small\n                style={{\n                  display: \"block\",\n                  fontSize: \"14px\",\n                  fontWeight: \"400\",\n                  fontFamily: '\"Nunito\", sans-serif',\n                  color: \"#313131\",\n                }}\n              >\n                Country Head <br /> Government Banking, Axis Bank\n              </small>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div\n          className=\"item mb-3\"\n          style={{\n           \n            background: \"#fff\",\n            padding: \"18px 30px\",\n            boxShadow: \"0 30px 50px rgba(205, 196, 219, 0.3)\",\n            borderRadius: \"10px\",\n          }}\n        >\n          <div className=\"quotes\" style={{ width: \"30px\" }}>\n            <img\n              style={{ maxWidth: \"100%\" }}\n              src=\"./web/images/quote.svg\"\n              alt=\"img\"\n            />\n          </div>\n          <p\n            style={{\n              fontSize: \"17px\",\n              fontWeight: \"400\",\n              color: \"#313131\",\n              fontFamily: '\"Nunito\", sans-serif',\n              padding: \"20px 0\",\n              textAlign: \"justify\",\n            }}\n          >\n            Knowing the team since so many years, especially after\n            experiencing their skill in deal curation; looking forward to\n            some exciting deals on the platform.\n          </p>\n          <div\n            style={{\n              display: \"flex\",\n              alignItems: \"center\",\n              marginTop: \"50px\",\n            }}\n            className=\"media\"\n          >\n            <div\n              style={{\n                display: \"flex\",\n                alignItems: \"center\",\n                justifyContent: \"center\",\n                height: \"70px\",\n                width: \"70px\",\n                textAlign: \"center\",\n                background: \"#fff\",\n                border: \"1px solid #D3CBE2\",\n                borderRadius: \"50%\",\n                overflow: \"hidden\",\n                lineHeight: \"65px\",\n              }}\n              className=\"images\"\n            >\n              <img\n                style={{\n                  height: \"60px\",\n                  width: \"60px\",\n                  borderRadius: \"50%\",\n                  objectFit: \"cover\",\n                }}\n                src=\"./assets/images/testimonials/mitul.jpg\"\n                alt=\"img\"\n              />\n            </div>\n            <div style={{ marginLeft: \"10px\" }} className=\"media-body\">\n              <a\n                style={{\n                  display: \"block\",\n                  fontSize: \"18px\",\n                  fontWeight: \"600\",\n                  color: \"#111111\",\n                  fontFamily: '\"Nunito\", serif',\n                }}\n                href=\"#\"\n              >\n                Mitul Jhaveri\n              </a>\n              <small\n                style={{\n                  display: \"block\",\n                  fontSize: \"14px\",\n                  fontWeight: \"400\",\n                  fontFamily: '\"Nunito\", sans-serif',\n                  color: \"#313131\",\n                }}\n              >\n                Director Finance, <br /> Regal Rexnord India\n              </small>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n  <section className=\"how-we-work-section\">\n    <div className=\"container\">\n      <div className=\"heading-title\">\n      <p><span></span> </p>\n        <h2>For Founders</h2>\n        <p style={{ textAlign: \"justify\" }}>\n          Growth91's robust private deal management option allows\n          Founders, Angel Investors, and Venture Capitalists to conduct\n          their fundraising process online, available exclusively to their\n          target audience. Don't get bogged down in continuous signing and\n          filing. It's easy, smooth, and uncomplicated.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"row\">\n        <div className=\"col-md-4\">\n          <div className=\"item mb-3\">\n            <div className=\"icon\">\n              <img src=\"./web/images/icon3.svg\" alt=\"img\" />\n              <span>1</span>\n            </div>\n            <h3 style={{ textAlign: \"center\" }}>Raise Growth Capital</h3>\n            <p style={{ textAlign: \"center\" }}>\n              Raise founder-friendly growth capital to scale your business\n            </p>\n            <div className=\"arrow-img\">\n              <img src=\"./web/images/arrow1.svg\" alt=\"img\" />\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"col-md-4\">\n          <div className=\"item mb-3\">\n            <div className=\"icon icon-tow\">\n              <img src=\"./web/images/icon4.svg\" alt=\"img\" />\n              <span>2</span>\n            </div>\n            <h3 style={{ textAlign: \"center\" }}>Seamless and Smooth</h3>\n            <p style={{ textAlign: \"center\" }}>\n              Raise capital with ease and confidence\n            </p>\n            <div className=\"arrow-img\" style={{ top: 60 }}>\n              <img src=\"./web/images/arrow2.svg\" alt=\"img\" />\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"col-md-4\">\n          <div className=\"item mb-3\">\n            <div className=\"icon icon-three\">\n              <img src=\"./web/images/icon5.svg\" alt=\"img\" />\n              <span>3</span>\n            </div>\n            <h3 style={{ textAlign: \"center\" }}>\n              Leverage established Network\n            </h3>\n            <p style={{ textAlign: \"center\" }}>\n              Tap the expertise of SME network for long term growth\n              proposition\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n  <section className=\"testimonials-section t_desktop\">\n    <div className=\"container\">\n      <div className=\"heading-title\">\n      <p><span></span> </p>\n        <h2>Testimonials Of Founders</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"testimonial_wraper owl-carousel\">\n        <div className=\"item\">\n          <div className=\"quotes\">\n            <img src=\"./web/images/quote.svg\" alt=\"img\" />\n          </div>\n          <p>\n            Normally, startup fund raise is quite a tedious process.\n            Knowing Growth91<sup>®</sup>{\" \"}\n            modus operandi gives great confidence that we can focus on our\n            core activities\n          </p>\n          <div className=\"media\">\n            <div className=\"images\">\n              <img\n                src=\"./assets/images/deals-details/TM (1).jpeg\"\n                alt=\"img\"\n              />\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"media-body\">\n              <a href=\"#\">Rahul Jain</a>\n              <small>\n                Managing Director, <br />\n                InnoServ Group\n              </small>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"item\">\n          <div className=\"quotes\">\n            <img src=\"./web/images/quote.svg\" alt=\"img\" />\n          </div>\n          <p>\n            It is good to know that end to end work related to fund raise\n            is taken care by Growth91\n           <sup>®</sup>. Looking forward\n            to list our deal at Growth91\n           <sup>®</sup>\n          </p>\n          <div className=\"media\">\n            <div className=\"images\">\n              <img\n                src=\"./assets/images/deals-details/TM (2).jpeg\"\n                alt=\"img\"\n              />\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"media-body\">\n              <a href=\"#\">Saumya Shah</a>\n              <small>\n                Founder & CEO, <br />\n                Tarrakki\n              </small>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div className=\"item\">\n          <div className=\"quotes\">\n            <img src=\"./web/images/quote.svg\" alt=\"img\" />\n          </div>\n          <p>\n            After knowing the details of modus operandi of Growth91\n           <sup>®</sup>, it gives great\n            confidence as the deal terms are truly balanced for investors\n            and startups. Will plan to raise our next round at Growth91\n           <sup>®</sup>\n          </p>\n          <div className=\"media\">\n            <div className=\"images\">\n              <img\n                src=\"./assets/images/deals-details/TM (3).jpeg\"\n                alt=\"img\"\n              />\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"media-body\">\n              <a href=\"#\">Dhruv Javeri</a>\n              <small>\n                Co-Founder & CEO, <br />\n                Klassroom\n              </small>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n  <section\n    className=\"testimonials-section t_mobile\"\n    style={{\n      textAlign: \"justify\",\n      background:\n        \"linear-gradient(269.83deg, rgba(232, 226, 255, 0.6) 40.65%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4) 100%),url(../images/testimonial-bg.png) no-repeat top center\",\n      backgroundSize: \"cover\",\n      padding: \"50px 0\",\n    }}\n  >\n    <div className=\"container\">\n      <div className=\"heading-title\">\n      <p><span></span> </p>\n        <h2>Testimonials Of Founders</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"testimonial_wraper_mobile\">\n        <div\n          className=\"item mb-3\"\n          style={{\n            background: \"#fff\",\n            padding: \"18px 30px\",\n            boxShadow: \"0 30px 50px rgba(205, 196, 219, 0.3)\",\n            borderRadius: \"10px\",\n          }}\n        >\n          <div className=\"quotes\" style={{ width: \"30px\" }}>\n            <img\n              style={{ maxWidth: \"100%\" }}\n              src=\"./web/images/quote.svg\"\n              alt=\"img\"\n            />\n          </div>\n          <p\n            style={{\n              fontSize: \"17px\",\n              fontWeight: \"400\",\n              color: \"#313131\",\n              fontFamily: '\"Nunito\", sans-serif',\n              padding: \"20px 0\",\n              textAlign: \"justify\",\n            }}\n          >\n            Normally, startup fund raise is quite a tedious process.\n            Knowing Growth91<sup>®</sup>{\" \"}\n            modus operandi gives great confidence that we can focus on our\n            core activities\n          </p>\n          <div\n            style={{\n              display: \"flex\",\n              alignItems: \"center\",\n              marginTop: \"50px\",\n            }}\n            className=\"media\"\n          >\n            <div\n              style={{\n                display: \"flex\",\n                alignItems: \"center\",\n                justifyContent: \"center\",\n                height: \"70px\",\n                width: \"70px\",\n                textAlign: \"center\",\n                background: \"#fff\",\n                border: \"1px solid #D3CBE2\",\n                borderRadius: \"50%\",\n                overflow: \"hidden\",\n                lineHeight: \"65px\",\n              }}\n              className=\"images\"\n            >\n              <img\n                style={{\n                  height: \"60px\",\n                  width: \"60px\",\n                  borderRadius: \"50%\",\n                  objectFit: \"cover\",\n                }}\n                src=\"./assets/images/deals-details/TM (1).jpeg\"\n                alt=\"img\"\n              />\n            </div>\n            <div style={{ marginLeft: \"10px\" }} className=\"media-body\">\n              <a\n                style={{\n                  display: \"block\",\n                  fontSize: \"18px\",\n                  fontWeight: \"600\",\n                  color: \"#111111\",\n                  fontFamily: '\"Nunito\", serif',\n                }}\n                href=\"#\"\n              >\n                Rahul Jain\n              </a>\n              <small\n                style={{\n                  display: \"block\",\n                  fontSize: \"14px\",\n                  fontWeight: \"400\",\n                  fontFamily: '\"Nunito\", sans-serif',\n                  color: \"#313131\",\n                }}\n              >\n                Managing Director, <br />\n                InnoServ Group\n              </small>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div\n          className=\"item mb-3\"\n          style={{\n        \n            background: \"#fff\",\n            padding: \"18px 30px\",\n            boxShadow: \"0 30px 50px rgba(205, 196, 219, 0.3)\",\n            borderRadius: \"10px\",\n          }}\n        >\n          <div className=\"quotes\" style={{ width: \"30px\" }}>\n            <img\n              style={{ maxWidth: \"100%\" }}\n              src=\"./web/images/quote.svg\"\n              alt=\"img\"\n            />\n          </div>\n          <p\n            style={{\n              fontSize: \"17px\",\n              fontWeight: \"400\",\n              color: \"#313131\",\n              fontFamily: '\"Nunito\", sans-serif',\n              padding: \"20px 0\",\n              textAlign: \"justify\",\n            }}\n          >\n            It is good to know that end to end work related to fund raise\n            is taken care by Growth91\n           <sup>®</sup>. Looking forward\n            to list our deal at Growth91\n           <sup>®</sup>\n          </p>\n          <div\n            style={{\n              display: \"flex\",\n              alignItems: \"center\",\n              marginTop: \"50px\",\n            }}\n            className=\"media\"\n          >\n            <div\n              style={{\n                display: \"flex\",\n                alignItems: \"center\",\n                justifyContent: \"center\",\n                height: \"70px\",\n                width: \"70px\",\n                textAlign: \"center\",\n                background: \"#fff\",\n                border: \"1px solid #D3CBE2\",\n                borderRadius: \"50%\",\n                overflow: \"hidden\",\n                lineHeight: \"65px\",\n              }}\n              className=\"images\"\n            >\n              <img\n                style={{\n                  height: \"60px\",\n                  width: \"60px\",\n                  borderRadius: \"50%\",\n                  objectFit: \"cover\",\n                }}\n                src=\"./assets/images/deals-details/TM (2).jpeg\"\n                alt=\"img\"\n              />\n            </div>\n            <div style={{ marginLeft: \"10px\" }} className=\"media-body\">\n              <a\n                style={{\n                  display: \"block\",\n                  fontSize: \"18px\",\n                  fontWeight: \"600\",\n                  color: \"#111111\",\n                  fontFamily: '\"Nunito\", serif',\n                }}\n                href=\"#\"\n              >\n                Saumya Shah\n              </a>\n              <small\n                style={{\n                  display: \"block\",\n                  fontSize: \"14px\",\n                  fontWeight: \"400\",\n                  fontFamily: '\"Nunito\", sans-serif',\n                  color: \"#313131\",\n                }}\n              >\n                Founder & CEO, <br />\n                Tarrakki\n              </small>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div\n          className=\"item mb-3\"\n          style={{\n       \n            background: \"#fff\",\n            padding: \"18px 30px\",\n            boxShadow: \"0 30px 50px rgba(205, 196, 219, 0.3)\",\n            borderRadius: \"10px\",\n          }}\n        >\n          <div className=\"quotes\" style={{ width: \"30px\" }}>\n            <img\n              style={{ maxWidth: \"100%\" }}\n              src=\"./web/images/quote.svg\"\n              alt=\"img\"\n            />\n          </div>\n          <p\n            className=\"paradh\"\n            style={{\n              fontSize: \"17px\",\n              fontWeight: \"400\",\n              color: \"#313131\",\n              fontFamily: '\"Nunito\", sans-serif',\n              padding: \"20px 0\",\n              textAlign: \"justify\",\n              marginbottom: \"25px\",\n            }}\n          >\n            After knowing the details of modus operandi of Growth91\n           <sup>®</sup>, it gives great\n            confidence as the deal terms are truly balanced for investors\n            and startups. Will plan to raise our next round at Growth91\n           <sup>®</sup>\n          </p>\n          <div\n            style={{\n              display: \"flex\",\n              alignItems: \"center\",\n              marginTop: \"30px\",\n            }}\n            className=\"media\"\n          >\n            <div\n              style={{\n                display: \"flex\",\n                alignItems: \"center\",\n                justifyContent: \"center\",\n                height: \"70px\",\n                width: \"70px\",\n                textAlign: \"center\",\n                background: \"#fff\",\n                border: \"1px solid #D3CBE2\",\n                borderRadius: \"50%\",\n                overflow: \"hidden\",\n                lineHeight: \"65px\",\n              }}\n              className=\"images\"\n            >\n              <img\n                style={{\n                  height: \"60px\",\n                  width: \"60px\",\n                  borderRadius: \"50%\",\n                  objectFit: \"cover\",\n                }}\n                src=\"./assets/images/deals-details/TM (3).jpeg\"\n                alt=\"img\"\n              />\n            </div>\n            <div style={{ marginLeft: \"10px\" }} className=\"media-body\">\n              <a\n                style={{\n                  display: \"block\",\n                  fontSize: \"18px\",\n                  fontWeight: \"600\",\n                  color: \"#111111\",\n                  fontFamily: '\"Nunito\", serif',\n                }}\n                href=\"#\"\n              >\n                Dhruv Javeri\n              </a>\n              <small\n                style={{\n                  display: \"block\",\n                  fontSize: \"14px\",\n                  fontWeight: \"400\",\n                  fontFamily: '\"Nunito\", sans-serif',\n                  color: \"#313131\",\n                }}\n              >\n                Co-Founder & CEO, <br />\n                Klassroom\n              </small>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section></div>\n  )\n}\n","/home/akc01/Desktop/projects/Growth91/apps/client/src/app/Homeblog.jsx",["9628","9629","9630"],[],"import axios from \"axios\";\nimport React, { useEffect, useState } from \"react\";\nimport Moment from \"react-moment\";\nimport moment from \"react-moment\";\n\nexport const Homeblog = () => {\n  const [blog, setBlog] = useState();\n  const [blog1, setBlog1] = useState();\n  const [blog2, setBlog2] = useState();\n  const [blogimg, setBlogimg] = useState();\n  const [blogimg1, setBlogimg1] = useState();\n  const [blogimg2, setBlogimg2] = useState();\nconst [loading, setLoading] = useState()\n  const blogs = async () => {\n    setLoading(true)\n    const data = await axios.get(\"https://growth91.com/blog/wp-json/wp/v2/posts\");\n    setBlog(data.data[0]);\n    setBlog1(data.data[1]);\n    setBlog2(data.data[2]);\n    setLoading(false)\n\n  };\n  useEffect(() => {\n    blogs();\n  }, []);\n  useEffect(() => {\n    callimg();\n    callimg1();\n    callimg2();\n  }, [blog]);\n\n  const callimg = async () => {\n    if(blog){\n\n      const data = await axios( blog._links[\"wp:featuredmedia\"][0].href);\n      setBlogimg(data.data.source_url);\n    }\n  };\n  const callimg1 = async () => {\n    if(blog){\n    const data = await axios(blog1._links[\"wp:featuredmedia\"][0].href);\n    setBlogimg1(data.data.source_url);}\n  };\n  const callimg2 = async () => {\n    if(blog){\n    const data = await axios(blog2._links[\"wp:featuredmedia\"][0].href);\n    setBlogimg2(data.data.source_url);}\n  };\n  return (\n    <>\n      {blog && blog1 ? (\n        <section class=\"business-crowd\">\n          <div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"row\">\n              <div class=\"heading-title founder-text\">\n                <p>\n                  <span></span>{\" \"}\n                </p>\n                <h2> Latest News and Trends in Indian Startup Investments</h2>\n                <p> Stay informed about the latest news, trends, and insights on investing in Indian startups through our expert-curated blog.\n                </p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"row blog-rows\">\n              <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-6 blog-columns\">\n                <div\n                  class=\"single-following-post aos-init aos-animate\"\n                  data-aos=\"fade-up\"\n                >\n                  <a href={blog.link} class=\"following-post-thum\">\n                    <img src={blog && blogimg} alt=\"\" />\n                  </a>\n                  <div class=\"following-post-content\">\n                    <div class=\"following-blog-post-top\">\n                      <div class=\"trending-blog-post-category\">\n                        <a href={blog.link} class=\"business\">\n                          Investment Guide\n                        </a>\n                      </div>\n                      <div class=\"following-blog-post-author\">\n                        By <a href={blog.link}>Admin</a>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <h5 class=\"following-blog-post-title\">\n                      <a href={blog.link}>{blog && blog.title.rendered}</a>\n                    </h5>\n                    <div class=\"following-blog-post-meta\">\n                      <div class=\"post-meta-left-side\">\n                        <span class=\"post-date\">\n                          <i class=\"fa-regular fa-calendar\"></i>\n                          <a href={blog.link}>\n                            {blog && (\n                              <Moment date={blog.date} format=\"MMM Do YY\" />\n                            )}\n                          </a>\n                        </span>\n                        {/* <span>10 min read</span> */}\n                      </div>\n                      {/* <div class=\"post-meta-right-side\">\n                    <a href={blog.link}>\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://htmldemo.net/bunzo/bunzo/assets/images/icons/small-bookmark.png\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                      />\n                    </a>\n                    <a href={blog.link}>\n                      <img\n                        src=\"https://htmldemo.net/bunzo/bunzo/assets/images/icons/heart.png\"\n                        alt=\"\"\n                      />\n                    </a>\n                  </div> */}\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-6 blog-columns\">\n                <div\n                  class=\"single-following-post aos-init aos-animate\"\n                  data-aos=\"fade-up\"\n                >\n                  <a href={blog1.link} class=\"following-post-thum\">\n                    <img src={blog && blogimg1} alt=\"\" />\n                  </a>\n                  <div class=\"following-post-content\">\n                    <div class=\"following-blog-post-top\">\n                      <div class=\"trending-blog-post-category\">\n                        <a href={blog1.link} class=\"business\">\n                          Investment Guide\n                        </a>\n                      </div>\n                      <div class=\"following-blog-post-author\">\n                        By <a href={blog1.link}>Admin</a>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <h5 class=\"following-blog-post-title\">\n                      <a href={blog1.link}> {blog && 